WEBVTT

NOTE
Train coupling sequence — the SeeD and presidential trains lock together, then the mission train arrives at a station.
Duration: approximately 30 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The green wagon detaches, leaving the red wagon and orange locomotive running ahead

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Orange pusher locomotive 'Raiders' runs forward, detaching as the coupling arm extends across the gap, leaving only the red wagon linked behind

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The presidential train keeps going forward as the track switch activates behind him

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Orange pusher locomotive 'Raiders' with stolen wagon takes a left turn

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The track switches again, and the detached wagon continues forward, reconnecting to the remnants of the presidential train

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The two trains split apart as the orange train moves further away
